{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56863","headline":"浓州人爲刺史歌（题从《古谣谚》卷二七） · 佚名","name":"浓州人爲刺史歌（题从《古谣谚》卷二七）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"可怜地上楼，百姓不知修。\n上有清使君，下有清江流。\n（见《全唐文》卷六一九戎昱《浓州新城颂序》引）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56863.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56863","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}